  "description": "## What's New\n- **New look throughout** — every icon is now Phosphor, with filled icons on the active tab\n- **Your own logo** — CIE.png is now the launcher icon and the in-app mark\n- **Preparing screen** — launch shows real progress instead of dumping you into Home\n- **Onboarding that checks you** — the 好 card now actually verifies your writing\n- **Introduce yourself** — a short final step seeds your study memory\n- **Editable study memory** — read and edit what your tutor remembers, in Settings\n- **Claude-style chat** — expandable thinking, tool results, memory diffs and live JSON\n\n## Fixes\n- Skip now shows the character for ~1.8s before moving on\n- Stroke order is hidden during blind reps, so it cannot give the answer away\n- About screen with GitHub and YouTube links"
}
